# Test artifacts
*.txt
scratch_tst.cpp
-
run_tests.ps1
nul
# The .ch10 fixtures are large and mostly gitignored, EXCEPT the small
# (<100 MB) committed CI fixtures below, which the hosted CI needs. The full-size
# variants (e.g. the full PRN and Safran recordings) stay local-only and are
# overlaid on the self-hosted runner. "data/test files/" is the canonical fixture
# folder - everything else directly under data/ (stray exports, scratch csv/png,
# one-off recordings) is ignored outright, and within test files/ itself only the
# four small fixtures below are tracked; the multi-GB "full" siblings next to them
# stay local-only on purpose.
data/*
!data/test files/
data/test files/*
!data/test files/agc_nzl_rasa_testfile.ch10
!data/test files/agc_rnrz-l_trc_testfile.ch10
!data/test files/prn_testfile, sample.ch10
!data/test files/safran_testfile, sample.ch10
output/
!output/.gitkeep

# Test build outputs
debug/
release/
